      en: ['T:YOU GOT THE FEATHER! GOOD FOR YOU. I STILL HAVE NO LEGS.', 'T:LISTEN. MY NEPHEW WANTS TO SEE THE WORLD. BEFORE WE CONQUER IT. TAKE HIM WITH YOU.', 'H:... HE LOOKS LIKE YOU. ONLY SMALLER.', 'T:MORE COMPACT. HE SLAPS ANYTHING THAT COMES CLOSE. AND HE TALKS. A LOT. FAR TOO MUCH.'],
      fr: ["T:TU AS LA PLUME ! TANT MIEUX POUR TOI. MOI, JE N'AI TOUJOURS PAS DE JAMBES.", "T:ÉCOUTE. MON NEVEU VEUT VOIR LE MONDE. AVANT QU'ON LE CONQUIÈRE. EMMÈNE-LE.", 'H:... IL TE RESSEMBLE. EN PLUS PETIT.', 'T:EN PLUS COMPACT. IL FRAPPE CE QUI APPROCHE. ET IL PARLE. BEAUCOUP. BEAUCOUP TROP.'],
